<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00164" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00164" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00164-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/freezingheart" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6401769); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6401769&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608474110" alt="Freezingheart" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6401769)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/freezingheart" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6401769); return false;">Freezingheart</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1588840447 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">07 May 2020 08:34</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00394/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一块█为智能手表，在进行时间超过30分钟的任务时，第24分钟佩戴者会不顾一切地看表<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/██/18<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>█安█技大学█汉校园军训场<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>存放于Site-CN-34的低危物品收容柜<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>这玩意让那个倒霉鬼多站了一个小时的军姿&#8212;&#8212;研究员ENC</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00394" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00394" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00394-hovertip">
